('b0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000106', 1, 'pre_test', 'In collision theory, why do energetic collisions between complex biomolecules often fail to produce products?', 'Improper Molecular Orientation (Steric Factor)', 'Excessive Atmospheric Humidity', 'Gravity Repulsion Between Atoms', 'Zero Molecular Velocity', 'A', 'Collisions must occur at correct spatial orientations (steric alignment) so reactive functional groups interact effectively.', 'assets/illustrations/term1/q39.svg', true),
